---
code: transport-session-lost
when-fires: a session produced no completion marker, so whether the remote artifact ran is unknown. cli/transport_edge.rs, both phases. {host} is the destination, {attempts} how many were made, {diagnosis} a decision-inert reading of what severed it.
why: 26A stop-2 plus rul-integrity-failure-withholds-mutation. Absence of output cannot prove absence of execution, so this is neither clean nor failed. Sibling of transport-not-attempted by WORLD STATE, not grammar: there nothing ran and the repair is the invocation, here something may have run and the repair is to re-probe.
